tourist streets in the Beilin District","11:00-21:00","","","","r","A tiny, family-run spot known only to locals, serving exceptional guotie (potstickers) and baozi (steamed buns) with secret-recipe fillings. No frills, just authentic flavor."],["Nanliu Alley night market","restaurant",34.25746,108.95171,"","open 10:00-22:00","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"],["Small World Cafe","restaurant",34.25218,108.95088,"Huancheng Nanlu Dongduan 90#","11:00-22:30","","","","r","Run by a Dutch woman and her Chinese husband. Known by the older generations as \"the oldest western restaurant in Xi'an\", which opened in the early 70s. Great European cafe feel. Good food. Pizza, salad, fried chicken and real cake.…"],["Zhen Er Lao Tan Sauerkraut Fish","restaurant",34.2464,108.9495,"93 Wenyi N Rd","","","","","r","Sichuan restaurant which has been around for a century."],["La Seine","restaurant",34.25942,108.94275,"Nandajie (南大街)","","","","","r","French style restaurant."],["MIX","bar",34.2595,108.9419,"Nanda St","","","","","r","Rather nice places to sit and drink."],["Night Cat","bar",34.2586,108.9427,"Nanda St","","","","","r","Dance floor, some foreigners and OK DJs."],["Havana Bar","bar",34.24463,108.94961,"319 Dongxin St","","","","","r","Has a Colombian band and makes good cocktails. It's not your average Buena Vista Social Club, though: they play loud music in between band performances and the band plays a wide array of pop and salsa. This location is more of a club…"]]}